      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Occasionally a coronary stent cannot be delivered. In this case, a dislodged stent was purposely pushed forward by the delivery balloon into position; a smaller, compliant balloon was used for initial deployment; and the original stent-delivery balloon was used for subsequent final deployment."},
